{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266dZqDasnjK1795782865.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國和柬埔寨舉行聯合軍事演習。</p><p></p><p>演習在柬埔寨西哈努克國際機場、雲壤港和王家軍聯合軍官學院等地，組織實施。由本月25日持續至下月9日。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CAM.CHINA-2300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026J6H7VzVhXr1795783946.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這次聯合演習主題是「和平、友誼、合作」，圍繞聯合反恐反海盜，以及人道主義救援行動課題，項目包括突擊營救、海上聯合搜救和緝捕等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CAM.CHINA-2300_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UuZQMIxNg01795783932.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>中方稱演習內容不針對第三方，亦與地區局勢和敏感議題無關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:55.020548+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:17:35.718064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:17.589831+00:00","content_hash":"d124b5246de23332f502be1127540b86f0c30e8575ece8e83aa34f9cafee65b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}